{
  "name": "dsh-paper-studio-v3",
  "version": "3.0.2",
  "description": "论文插件 V3（对话驱动、无面板、双模式、五种写作模式）：把「论文方案」（论文框架 + 方法论 + 工作流）做成 DSH 原生的两个工具 —— paper_studio（一个多路复用入口，桥接已冻结的 paper-studio CLI）与 paper_dev（开发者模式：展示并允许改工作流/框架/数据/脚本；用户模式下写入真被拒）。纯粹用对话驱动：模式选择走宿主的 ask_user_question 可点击选项，不注册任何面板。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./dist/plugin.js",
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "skill",
    "hub",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "paper",
    "academic-writing",
    "paper-studio",
    "no-panel",
    "dual-mode"
  ],
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "*"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": {
      "optional": true
    }
  }
}
